<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00331">
	<title>Heating and air conditioning automatically</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>automatic climate control system 
					<indexterm>heating and air conditioning automatically</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<ol>
			<li>
				<p>Touch the <term translate="no">AUTO</term> icon.</p>
				<p>The modes, fan speeds, air intake and air-conditioning will be controlled automatically by setting the temperature.</p>
				<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02469">
					<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
						<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
						<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
						<tbody>
							<row rowsep="1">
								<entry colname="col1">
									<fig id="e02470">
										<figgroup>
											<image href="../../images/N_CT25C086.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e02471"/>
										</figgroup>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col2"/>
							</row>
						</tbody>
					</tgroup>
				</table>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Push the temperature control lever up or down to the desired temperature.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02472">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02473">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV035304.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e02474"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<note type="note">
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>To turn the automatic operation off, select any button or lever of the following:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<p>Mode selection icon/lever</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Air conditioning icon</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Front windshield defroster icon (Touch the icon one more time to deselect the front windshield defroster function. The <term translate="no">AUTO</term> sign will illuminate on the information display once again.)</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Fan speed control icon/lever</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p>The selected function will be controlled manually while other functions operate automatically.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>For your convenience and to improve the effectiveness of the climate control, use the <term translate="no">AUTO</term> icon and set the temperature to 22 °C (72 °F).</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
		<note type="note">
			<p>Never place anything over the sensor (1) located on the instrument panel to ensure better control of the heating and cooling system.</p>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02475">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e02476">
									<figgroup>
										<image href="../../images/OOV035002.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e02477"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>